          "content": "After completing this unit, a student should be able to state the relevant physical mechanisms, define the operational measurement and its units, solve an idealized numerical problem with a unit check, identify competing explanations for a trend, evaluate one manufacturing tradeoff and write an evidence-based decision memo. The outcomes should be judged through worked calculations and a specific observation plan, not just by the ability to repeat terminology.",
